/T ( On Oct 2nd at 7pm, we will gather together again in the Walk for Hope at Grove Park in partnership with The Refuge Utah. This candlelight walk is more than an event. It is a moment for our community to come together in solidarity, to support and honor victims and survivors of domestic violence, and to remind one another that no one should ever feel alone in their struggles.)
/E ( On Oct 2nd at 7pm, we will gather together again in the Walk for Hope at Grove Park in partnership with The Refuge Utah. This candlelight walk is more than an event. It is a moment for our community to come together in solidarity, to support and honor victims and survivors of domestic violence, and to remind one another that no one should ever feel alone in their struggles.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
